# Build the dev app

After changing SlimPomo, build and restart only the dev app before finishing. Running tests is not a substitute, and the release app is not part of this step.

Run `scripts/dev.sh` with no flags. It rebuilds `SlimPomo Dev.app`, quits a running copy, and launches it again. Do not pass `--seed`, `--reset`, or any other flag unless asked.
